    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but boundaries don't work. i've tried. people just push harder. it's like i don't even matter, only what i can do for them matters. when i think about \"release,\" i don't mean a break or a boundary. i mean like... an actual end to the noise. just finally being able to stop existing so i don't have to carry it anymore. i just want the peace of not having to be \"me\" anymore.",
